# GitHub Scrum board
Board: Project 1 "QA-lab URL Review" (https://github.com/orgs/carlosandmunoz-hq/projects/1), repo `kaanmuar/kaanmuar.github.io`. Columns: Backlog, Next, Design, Dev, QA, Stg, Prod, Done.
Use `scripts/ticket.sh` for every board chore; its header lists the commands (`new`, `bug`, `design`, `move`, `child`, `done`, `log`).

- **Every piece of work has a ticket.** Find it, or `scripts/ticket.sh new "<title>" <area> dev` (`kind:request` + one `area:*`). Move it as the work moves; reference it in the PR body.
- **Everything found while developing is its own issue** tied to the ticket: each bug, regression, incongruence (copy vs behaviour, page vs page, main vs production) or process slip, even if fixed in the same PR. `scripts/ticket.sh bug <ticket> "BE: A null MX record was read as missing mail setup" <area> "<what happened>" "<fix>" [fixed-pr]` writes the standard body, links it as a sub-issue, and closes it Done with the PR or leaves it in Backlog. `new` and `bug` list open issues that look the same (#2969), but without a terminal they file anyway: run them with `--dry-run` first, comment on the matching issue instead of filing, and file with `--no-dup-check` once none matches.
- A PR that fixes a URL review failure cause class adds a row to `FIXES` in `functions/url-review-failures.js` (cause, merge time, PR), so the failed runs it covers are re-run.
- **Design deliverables** (templates, layouts, images, logos, icons, share images, social posts, motion, copy and visual changes, and later updates to any of them) each get `scripts/ticket.sh design <ticket> "Design: ..." "<decisions, file paths, live link>"`; set Done when it ships.

## GitHub API budget
All chats share kaanmuar's 5,000 GraphQL points an hour (#892); `gh issue`, `gh pr`, `gh pr checks` and `gh project` spend it.
- Issues, comments, labels, sub-issues: REST (`gh api repos/...`), as `scripts/ticket.sh` does.
- CI: `scripts/ci-wait.sh <sha|pr>` (one blocking REST watch per run, prints only failed steps). Never `gh pr checks --watch`.
- Main fixed, PRs still red: `scripts/refresh-prs.sh [workflow]` closes and reopens them for a fresh merge. Never re-run a PR's failed jobs (`gh run rerun`): that tests the old merge commit (#2245).
- PRs: `gh api repos/kaanmuar/kaanmuar.github.io/pulls -f title=... -f head=<branch> -f base=main -f body=...`; merge with `gh api -X PUT .../pulls/<n>/merge -f merge_method=squash`.
- Board moves only through `scripts/gh-budget.sh` (qa-lab-agents app first), which `scripts/ticket.sh` uses.
